	note = {arXiv:2207.12202 [cs] TLDR: Inspired by YOLOv5-DeepSORT, the proposal of Y OLOv7 network, which performs better in object detection, is applied as the object detection part to the DeepSORT and proposed YOLov7- deepSORT performances better in tracking accuracy.},
